NOTE ON DATA. This licence covers the source code only. The datasets the pipeline
consumes are not licensed under these terms. Each source carries its own licence,
recorded per dataset in scripts/config.py and in the project's data acquisition
manifest. Most Office for National Statistics output is available under the Open
Government Licence v3.0; the Open Geography Portal boundary products additionally
require Ordnance Survey attribution. The Sunday Times Rich List is not open data,
and only published aggregate figures are used here, as attributed quotations.
